# Experiment data are valuable: keep CSV, logs, device/environment information,
# command/provenance JSON, source hashes, patches and completion/exit markers.
# Exclude build directories and duplicate source snapshots from Git only.
# Keep snapshots on disk; their identity and patch remain eligible for Git.
/accuracy_test/**/results/**/source/
/speed_test/**/results/**/source/
/code_test/**/results/**/source/
